  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: main.swift with top-level Service().run() yields only a connectivity_based entrypoint (Service.run, 0.5); an @main struct App { static func main() } also yields only connectivity_based (App.main is kind method, so main-functions.yaml's ^main$/^function$ swift rule misses it). Premise holds; the @main shape is missed too. MECHANISM: swift entrypoint rule (main-functions.yaml) matches only a free function named main; no main.swift top-level or @main detector."  # 98e3
